{title: Daughter of Jerimoth}
{subtitle: 2 Chronicles 11:18–19}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 83}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [Dm] | [Bb] | [Dm] |
| [Bb] | [Dm] | [Bb] [C] | [Dm] |
| [Bb] [C] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]King Rehoboam took a [Bb]wife
Her [Dm]name was Mahalath the [Bb]light
[Dm]She came from David's [Bb]house
[C]Daughter of Jeri[Dm]moth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[C]Daughter of Jeri[Bb]moth
[C]Blood of the ancient [Dm]king
Mother of sons [Bb]three
Hear the [C]story she [Dm]brings
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Her mother was Abi[Bb]hail
[Dm]Daughter of E[Bb]liab
From [Dm]Jesse's line she [Bb]came
[C]Walking in an ancient [Dm]way
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Daughter of Jeri[Bb]moth
[C]Blood of the ancient [Dm]king
Mother of sons [Bb]three
Hear [C]the story she [Dm]brings
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
She bore him Jeush [Bb]first
She[Dm]mariah and Za[Bb]ham
Names [Dm]recorded in the [Bb]book
[C]Sons of her and [Dm]of the king
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Mahalath the [Bb]wife
[C]Daughter of Jeri[Dm]moth
The history of her [Bb]sons
[C]Kept in the roy[Dm]al scroll
{end_of_verse}

